anged the formula in that way somebody  should be going to leafy places like  tunbridge wells as opposed to places  that are perhaps more urban it needs to  be in the the most needing places and  that doesn't just have to be in urban  inner city areas and i see that in my  own constituency why do we think that  richie sunic is behind in many of the  polls that we're seeing right now that  mr darden  well i i've been in politics  well i'm not saying you can't trust the  polls what i am saying is we have seen  time and time again that polls have not  proved to be correct whether that's in  relation to brexit donald trump you you  name it all different polls come out the  key thing is the members i trust the  members of this this party i work with  incredibly closely as chairman and over  many years i know that in the end  they'll look at the candidates and they  can seem risky sooner someone with the  values with the experience and the  capability to lead our nation

